{
  "id": "S02",
  "order": 2,
  "title": "Sonido",
  "summary": "Sintes, envolventes, filtros y efectos: cómo suena cada nota.",
  "prerequisite": "S01",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "S02-U01",
      "title": "Sintes y samples",
      "goal": "Elegir entre grabaciones y sintes, y tocar notas con note.",
      "lesson": "s02-u01",
      "requires": [],
      "katas": [
        {
          "id": "S02-U01-K1",
          "title": "De sample a sinte",
          "brief": "Cambia el piano por el sinte `sawtooth`.",
          "starter": "note(\"c3 e3 g3 c4\").s(\"piano\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c3 e3 g3 c4\").s(\"sawtooth\")",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["note"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["sawtooth"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["`s` elige el sonido: una grabación o un sinte."]
        },
        {
          "id": "S02-U01-K2",
          "title": "Cuatro ondas",
          "brief": "Con `< >`, haz que cada ciclo suene con una onda distinta: `sawtooth`, `square`, `triangle` y `sine`.",
          "starter": "note(\"c3 e3 g3 c4\").s(\"sawtooth\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c3 e3 g3 c4\").s(\"<sawtooth square triangle sine>\")",
          "cycles": 4,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["note"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["sawtooth", "square", "triangle", "sine"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["`< >` también funciona dentro de `s`."]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02-U02",
      "title": "Envolvente",
      "goal": "Dar forma a una nota con attack y release.",
      "lesson": "s02-u02",
      "requires": [],
      "katas": [
        {
          "id": "M10-T03-K2",
          "title": "Pad que respira",
          "brief": "Convierte estas notas en un pad: sinte `sawtooth`, ataque lento con `attack` y una cola larga con `release`.",
          "starter": "note(\"<[a3,c4,e4] [f3,a3,c4] [c3,e3,g3] [g3,b3,d4]>\").s(\"piano\")",
          "solution": "note(\"<[a3,c4,e4] [f3,a3,c4] [c3,e3,g3] [g3,b3,d4]>\").s(\"sawtooth\").attack(0.5).release(1)",
          "cycles": 4,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["attack", "release"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["sawtooth"]
            },
            {
              "type": "chordPerCycle",
              "chords": ["Am", "F", "C", "G"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": [
            "El piano es un sample y no sostiene: cambia `s(\"piano\")` por `s(\"sawtooth\")`.",
            "`attack` y `release` se miden en segundos."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "S02-U02-K1",
          "title": "Golpe corto",
          "brief": "Haz un sonido percusivo: ataque casi nulo con `attack` y una cola muy corta con `release`.",
          "starter": "note(\"c3*4\").s(\"triangle\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c3*4\").s(\"triangle\").attack(0.01).release(0.1)",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["attack", "release"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["triangle"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["Prueba `attack(0.01)` y `release(0.1)`: se miden en segundos."]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02-U03",
      "title": "Filtros",
      "goal": "Oscurecer y aclarar un sonido con lpf y hpf.",
      "lesson": "s02-u03",
      "requires": [],
      "katas": [
        {
          "id": "M10-T03-K1",
          "title": "Bajo oscuro",
          "brief": "Este bajo `sawtooth` es muy brillante: ponle un filtro pasa bajos con `lpf` para oscurecerlo (prueba 600).",
          "starter": "note(\"c2 c2 eb2 g1\").s(\"sawtooth\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c2 c2 eb2 g1\").s(\"sawtooth\").lpf(600)",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["lpf"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["sawtooth"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["`.lpf(600)` corta lo que está por encima de 600 Hz."]
        },
        {
          "id": "S02-U03-K1",
          "title": "Sin graves",
          "brief": "Quita los graves de este sinte con `hpf`, el filtro pasa altos (prueba 800).",
          "starter": "note(\"c2 c3 c2 g2\").s(\"sawtooth\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c2 c3 c2 g2\").s(\"sawtooth\").hpf(800)",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["hpf"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["sawtooth"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["El número de `hpf` es la frecuencia de corte en Hz."]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S02-U04",
      "title": "Efectos y mezcla",
      "goal": "Dar espacio y equilibrio con room, delay, gain y pan.",
      "lesson": "s02-u04",
      "requires": [],
      "katas": [
        {
          "id": "M10-T03-K3",
          "title": "Sala y eco",
          "brief": "Cambia el piano por el soundfont `gm_epiano1` y dale espacio con `room` y un eco con `delay`.",
          "starter": "note(\"c4 eb4 g4 c5\").s(\"piano\")",
          "solution": "note(\"c4 eb4 g4 c5\").s(\"gm_epiano1\").room(0.6).delay(0.4)",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["gm_epiano1"]
            },
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["room", "delay"]
            },
            {
              "type": "notesWithinScale",
              "scale": "C:minor"
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["Los soundfonts se eligen con `s`, como cualquier sonido: `s(\"gm_epiano1\")`."]
        },
        {
          "id": "S02-U04-K1",
          "title": "Mezcla mínima",
          "brief": "Baja el hi-hat con `gain` y llévalo a un lado con `pan`, para que el bombo mande.",
          "starter": "stack(\n  s(\"bd*4\"),\n  s(\"hh*8\")\n)",
          "solution": "stack(\n  s(\"bd*4\"),\n  s(\"hh*8\").gain(0.4).pan(0.8)\n)",
          "cycles": 1,
          "assertions": [
            {
              "type": "usesFunction",
              "names": ["stack", "gain", "pan"]
            },
            {
              "type": "soundsInclude",
              "names": ["bd", "hh"]
            }
          ],
          "hints": ["`pan` va de 0 (izquierda) a 1 (derecha)."]
        }
      ],
      "practice": {
        "mix": [
          {
            "generator": "sound-design",
            "params": {
              "functions": [
                "lpf",
                "hpf",
                "lpq",
                "room",
                "delay",
                "shape",
                "vowel",
                "attack",
                "release"
              ]
            },
            "weight": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "boss": {
    "id": "S02-BOSS",
    "title": "Bajo y pad",
    "brief": "Crea un bajo y un pad con sonidos distintos. Usa un filtro `lpf` y reverberación con `room`.",
    "starter": "stack(\n  note(\"c2 ~ c2 g1\").s(\"sawtooth\"),\n  note(\"[c3,e3,g3]\").s(\"triangle\")\n)",
    "cycles": 2,
    "assertions": [
      {
        "type": "usesFunction",
        "names": ["lpf", "room"]
      },
      {
        "type": "layerCount",
        "min": 2
      }
    ],
    "rubric": [
      {
        "id": "rhythm",
        "label": "El bajo marca un pulso claro",
        "weight": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "sound",
        "label": "Cada sonido tiene carácter propio",
        "weight": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "code",
        "label": "Código claro y fácil de cambiar",
        "weight": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "music",
        "label": "Las dos capas suenan bien juntas",
        "weight": 2
      }
    ],
    "passScore": 7
  }
}
